    "dialogue:ep90-map-intro-1:en": {
      "text": "The man on the road continued to wave a warning.",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/32e681f8fe42.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n001"
    },
    "dialogue:ep90-map-intro-1:zh": {
      "text": "那名男子在道路上继续挥手示意警告。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_zh/b80f3e4a4518.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n001"
    },
    "dialogue:ep90-map-intro-2:en": {
      "text": "Trembling with fear, the Tang Monk fell from his horse.",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/b7f446cbdbc6.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n002"
    },
    "dialogue:ep90-map-intro-2:zh": {
      "text": "唐僧因恐惧而浑身颤抖,随即从马背上跌落。",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_zh/d564c93324f7.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n002"
    },
    "dialogue:ep90-map-quiz-1:en": {
      "text": "\"Yes, it's me, the spirit of the planet Venus. I came in disguise to warn you, Wukong. There are three powerful demons on the mountain up ahead. The first is a lion demon. The second is an elephant demon. And the third is a raptor demon.\"",
      "lang": "en-US",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_en/46cde57e4677.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n010"
    },
    "dialogue:ep90-map-quiz-1:zh": {
      "text": "\"没错,就是我——金星之灵。我乔装打扮前来警告你,悟空。前方山上有三只强大的魔怪:第一只是狮子魔,第二只是象魔,第三只则是猛禽魔。\"",
      "lang": "zh-CN",
      "kind": "static-existing",
      "src": "assets/adv_audio/sent_zh/78d996ddab9c.mp3",
      "sourceNodeId": "n010"
    },
